abstract: >
  Open institutional dataset containing anonymized records from online higher
  education programs at Universidad ECOTEC (Ecuador). The repository supports
  reproducible research in learning analytics, educational data mining,
  explainable artificial intelligence, fairness-aware AI, and educational
  decision-support systems.

